TI  - A knowledge-Aware NLP-Driven conversational model to detect deceptive contents on social media posts
AU  - Jain, D.K.
AU  - Neelakandan, S.
AU  - Vidyarthi, A.
AU  - Mishra, A.
AU  - Alkhayyat, A.
