TI  - Hippocampal Cofilin and CFL1 gene variants are linked to Alcohol Use Disorder phenotypes
AU  - Salamian, A.
AU  - Pagano, R.
AU  - Skonieczna, E.
AU  - Kalinichenko, L.S.
AU  - Puchalska, M.
AU  - Yiğit Ünlü, G.
