lassification; discrete Channel Mapping in Knowledge Distillation; Uncertainty-Aware Semantic Decoding for LLM-Based Sequential Recommendation; Dual-Stream Adaptive Retrieval and Hierarchical Agent Collaboration for Document Visual QA; retrieval and Distill: A Temporal Data Shift-Free Paradigm for Online Recommendation System.
